<!--
  Privacy usage strings required by the QRRTU Audit iOS app.

  In Xcode 15/16 there is usually no visible Info.plist file. Add these via:
    Project navigator -> select the target -> "Info" tab -> "Custom iOS Target Properties"
    -> hover a row, click "+", and add each key below (choose the friendly name,
       Xcode maps it to the raw key shown in the comment).

  If your project DOES have an Info.plist file, paste the <key>/<string> pairs
  inside its top-level <dict>.
-->

<!-- Privacy - Camera Usage Description  (NSCameraUsageDescription) -->
<key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
<string>QRRTU Audit uses the camera to take field photos of rooftop units.</string>

<!-- Privacy - Location When In Use Usage Description  (NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription) -->
<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
<string>QRRTU Audit stamps your field photos with GPS coordinates.</string>

<!-- Privacy - Photo Library Usage Description  (NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription) -->
<key>NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription</key>
<string>QRRTU Audit lets you choose existing photos of rooftop units.</string>

<!-- Privacy - Photo Library Additions Usage Description  (NSPhotoLibraryAddUsageDescription) -->
<key>NSPhotoLibraryAddUsageDescription</key>
<string>QRRTU Audit can save captured photos to your library.</string>
